  None,                    !- Humidification Control Type
  0.0,                     !- Humidification Setpoint {kgWater/kgDryAir}
  0.0,                     !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Person {m3/s-person}
  0.0,                     !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}
  0.0,                     !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone {m3/s}
  0.0,                     !- Outdoor Air Flow Rate per Zone ACH {1/hr}
  None,                    !- Demand Controlled Ventilation Type
  No;                      !- Outdoor Air Economizer Type

